{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "contract": "A loader is supported by an adapter that can discover compatible versions, materialize a launcher profile/libraries, declare Java constraints, and produce a deterministic launch plan. Unsupported legacy loaders may be imported through an explicit user-provided launcher-profile adapter rather than guessed.",
